qualification = "The final verify row in /out/run/gates.jsonl records the verified revision, exact command, exit code and private log; qualification requires exit zero and a successful build row at that same revision. The runner records the candidate revision externally because embedding its own commit hash would change this record and invalidate the build. No pre-change test run or unexecuted gate is claimed."
